Dogtag PKI is an enterprise-class open source Certificate Authority (CA).
It supports all aspects of certificate lifecycle management, including key
archival, OCSP, and smartcard management.

This port provides the Certificate Authority (CA) subsystem running on
Apache Tomcat, the pki command line interface, the pkispawn/pkidestroy
deployment tools, and the Python client and server modules for
administering Dogtag PKI certificate services.
